  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758566,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 007 - The Living Daylights (MSX) - Synopsis\n\nStep into the shoes of James Bond in *007 - The Living Daylights* for the MSX, a thrilling platform shooter based on the iconic 1987 film.  The game faithfully recreates Bond's perilous mission to protect Max Zorin, a ruthless arms dealer, while uncovering a deadly plot involving a scheme to manipulate the world's dairy industry.\n\nNavigate through a series of horizontally scrolling levels, each meticulously designed to capture the film's atmosphere, from snowy Austrian ski resorts to Zorin's opulent estate. Engage in fast-paced action, shooting down a variety of enemies – from henchmen to heavily armed guards – using Bond's signature Walther PPK.  \n\nBeyond straightforward shooting, the game incorporates elements of puzzle-solving and stealth.  Utilize gadgets like the grappling hook and ski to overcome obstacles and reach hidden areas.  Experience the thrill of Bond's world, complete with recognizable locations and a pulse-pounding soundtrack.  *007 - The Living Daylights* delivers a classic Bond experience tailored for the MSX platform."
    },
